{
  "description": "The list operations take `page` and `per_page` and answer `pagination.total_pages` beside `resources` (the `Pagination` schema in the spec, read 2026-11-01), but the converter's page detection only runs on STACKIT's own documents, so none got a paginated surface. Without it `.items` doesn't exist, and a caller reading one page would miss routes and apps.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.stackit.cloud_foundry#ListApps/traits/smithy.api#paginated",
      "value": {
        "mode": "page",
        "inputToken": "page",
        "outputToken": "pagination.total_pages",
        "items": "resources",
        "pageSize": "per_page"
      }
    },
    {
